# G-5: moving a stuck unit with Karmada application failover (tolerationSeconds 30, purgeMode Gracefully, gracePeriodSeconds 60)
# unit shape aa: 2 Pods x 1 GPU with required pod anti-affinity -> needs 2 nodes. No Karmada estimator can see pod anti-affinity.
# k014-m2 and k014-m3 have one node (the unit gets stuck there), k014-m1 has two worker nodes (the unit fits).
# note: the first attempt was rejected by the Karmada webhook: 'application failover is set, propagateDeps must be true'

